{"4233570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Litmustest", "steam_appid": 4233570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/813c0a83b70d6cc616886a8244eaab68.avif?t=1787244007\" width=1024 height=100 /></span><strong>Litmustest</strong> is a <strong>Horror Search Action</strong> game. Search every room, manage a limited inventory, solve puzzles and fight against the dangers spawning from the depths of this facility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/53c5d123c49a08d4e946ec0b3a37b27e.poster.avif?t=1787244007\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/53c5d123c49a08d4e946ec0b3a37b27e.webm?t=1787244007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/53c5d123c49a08d4e946ec0b3a37b27e.mp4?t=1787244007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/dc0cf5cee57db9b2ef36a01dd822c832.avif?t=1787244007\" width=1024 height=100 /></span><strong>Nova Conti</strong> is a researcher at <strong>Obyekt</strong> <strong>Grovnyca,</strong> a<strong> </strong>research facility so classified it doesn't appear on any public record. She's working a late shift when the protocol kicks in. A colleague calls from somewhere deep in the building, locked in with no way out, reporting that security has gone completely silent. Then the line cuts off. The exits lock. Nova is trapped inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/f11145542275de7d62de9409741bdab1.poster.avif?t=1787244007\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/f11145542275de7d62de9409741bdab1.webm?t=1787244007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/f11145542275de7d62de9409741bdab1.mp4?t=1787244007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/5d86cea01ba29689a866dede066aefd9.avif?t=1787244007\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixed camera</strong> angles and <strong>Tank Controls</strong>. A <strong>limited inventory</strong> that forces real decisions about what you carry and what you leave behind. You can fight what's in here but sometimes it's smarter to find another way around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/d538062f00110443d1c47c91aac2fcd2.poster.avif?t=1787244007\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/d538062f00110443d1c47c91aac2fcd2.webm?t=1787244007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/d538062f00110443d1c47c91aac2fcd2.mp4?t=1787244007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/11c6cc3d2f61638b1165be686a12b2d4.avif?t=1787244007\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Litmustest</strong> uses cel-shaded graphics and a comic book stylized visual design. Immerse yourself in the dark rooms of <strong>Obyekt</strong> <strong>Grovnyca</strong> but be aware of the evil in the dark.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/4729822b6e42ba1a86814f1e655d2e3d.poster.avif?t=1787244007\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/4729822b6e42ba1a86814f1e655d2e3d.webm?t=1787244007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/4729822b6e42ba1a86814f1e655d2e3d.mp4?t=1787244007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233570/extras/813c0a83b70d6cc616886a8244eaab68.avif?t=1787244007\" width=1024 height=100 /></span><strong>Litmustest</strong> is a <strong>Horror Search Action</strong> game. Search every room, manage a limited inventory, solve puzzles and fight against the dangers spawning from the depths of this facility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im